+# Feature Specification: Long-Stay Discount
+
+**Feature Branch**: `003-long-stay-discount`
+**Created**: 2026-10-22
+**Status**: Draft
+**Input**: User description: "Reward customers who stay longer. A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total. The total stays a whole number of euro cents, rounded to the nearest cent (half up)."
+
+## User Scenarios & Testing *(mandatory)*
+
+### User Story 1 - Cheaper long rentals (Priority: P1)
+
+Desk staff quote or book a rental of 3 or more days and see a total 10% below the full price (number of days x daily price).
+
+**Why this priority**: It is the whole feature.
+
+**Independent Test**: With a board at 25.00 EUR/day, a 3-day quote shows 67.50 EUR instead of 75.00 EUR, and booking the same period records 67.50 EUR.
+
+**Acceptance Scenarios**:
+
+1. **Given** a rental of exactly 3 days, **When** quoting, **Then** the total is 90% of days x daily price.
+2. **Given** a rental of more than 3 days, **When** booking, **Then** the booking total is 90% of full price, equal to the quote for the same request.
+3. **Given** a rental of 1 or 2 days, **When** quoting or booking, **Then** the total is the full price.
+4. **Given** a discounted total that is not a whole number of cents, **When** quoting, **Then** it is rounded to the nearest cent, halves rounding up.
+
+### Edge Cases
+
+- A free item (price 0) stays at 0.
+- Invalid periods and unknown items are rejected as before.
+- Booking conflicts and availability are unaffected.
+
+## Requirements *(mandatory)*
+
+### Functional Requirements
+
+- **FR-001**: Rentals of 3 or more days MUST have a total of 90% of (days x daily price).
+- **FR-002**: Rentals of fewer than 3 days MUST keep the full price.
+- **FR-003**: Quote and booking MUST show the same reduced total for the same request.
+- **FR-004**: Totals MUST be whole euro cents, rounded to nearest, halves up.
+
+## Success Criteria *(mandatory)*
+
+- **SC-001**: For every rental of 3+ days the quoted and booked totals equal the full price less 10%, rounded to the cent.
+- **SC-002**: No rental under 3 days changes price.
+
+## Assumptions
+
+- The discount is a flat 10% on the whole rental, not only on days beyond the second.
+- Applies to all equipment kinds; no stacking with other discounts (none exist).
+- Existing bookings are not repriced.
